===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=p|aa=dostávat}}

# to [[get]] {{gloss|to receive}}
#: {{ux|cs|K dvacátým narozeninám '''dostal''' motorku, ale k následujícím narozeninám '''nedostal''' nic.|For his twentieth birthday, he got a motorcycle, but for the following birthday, he received nothing.}}
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-se}} to [[get]] [[somewhere]]
#: {{ux|cs|[[moci|Nemohl]] '''se dostat''' [[dovnitř]], [[dokud]] [[mu]] [[zevnitř]] [[otevřít|neotevřel]] [[přítel]], [[který]] '''se''' [[dovnitř]] '''dostal''' [[tajný|tajným]] [[vchod|vchodem]].|He couldn't '''get''' in until his friend, who '''got''' in through the secret entrance, opened from inside.}}
#: {{ux|cs|[[to|To]] [[pomoct|pomohlo]] [[jí]] '''dostat se''' [[z]] [[toho]] [[místo|místa]].|That helped her '''get out''' of this place.}}
#: {{ux|cs|[[myslet|Myslím]] [[že]] [[jsem]] '''se''' [[konečně]] '''dostala''' [[do]] [[můj|mého]] [[kreativní|kreativního]] [[podvědomí]].|I think I finally '''broke through''' to my creative unconscious.}}
#: {{ux|cs|[[být|Byl]] [[mladý]] [[když]] '''se dostal''' [[k]] [[moci]].|He was a young man when he '''rose''' to power.}}

